          "description": "Brought to you by Ladybird. \n\nA heart-warming, and engaging, collection of original audio stories celebrating Holi.  Join the festival of colour in this collection of stories celebrating the Hindu festival of Holi.  With tasty treats and bonfire tales, these stories are fun and informative stories for 3-7 year olds.  These stories are perfect for young children celebrating Holi with their friends and family, or wanting to learn about different Hindu traditions.  These stories are aimed at children aged three to six for family listening, learning, and the development of young minds.  \n\nOther audiobooks in the Ladybird Audio Original series include Ladybird Magical Stories, Ladybird Sleepy Tales and the Ladybird Audio Adventures series.",
